/// A PEM-encoded private key with no accompanying certificate. Mirrors
/// `github.com/siderolabs/crypto/x509.PEMEncodedKey` — used for `SecretsBundle.certs.k8sserviceaccount`,
/// the one [common.SecretsBundle] cert entry that has no certificate of its own. Also the return type of
/// [PEMCertificateAndKey.toPEMEncodedKey()].
module common.PEMEncodedKey

/// Base64-encoded PEM private key.
key: String
